            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "관리자 인증에 실패했습니다 (OSStatus %@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Administrator authentication is required to activate the Pasu FS protection system extension." : {
      "comment" : "Shown by macOS in its administrator password dialog; read from this catalog when the installer registers the right.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pasu FS 보호 시스템 확장 프로그램을 활성화하려면 관리자 인증이 필요합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Administrator authentication is required to deactivate the Pasu FS protection system extension." : {
      "comment" : "Shown by macOS in its administrator password dialog; read from this catalog when the installer registers the right.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pasu FS 보호 시스템 확장 프로그램을 비활성화하려면 관리자 인증이 필요합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Administrator authentication is required to reduce the protection of a Pasu FS policy." : {
      "comment" : "Shown by macOS in its administrator password dialog; read from this catalog when the installer registers the right.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pasu FS 정책의 보호를 줄이려면 관리자 인증이 필요합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Administrator authentication is required to uninstall Pasu FS from this Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Shown by macOS in its administrator password dialog; read from this catalog when the installer registers the right.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "이 Mac에서 Pasu FS를 제거하려면 관리자 인증이 필요합니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Administrator authentication needs an interactive macOS login session." : {
